\par\par \uc2 Books\par \b \uc2 Dawn\u8217\'20\'19s Early Light by Kevin Roberts review \u8211\'20\'13 weird vibes and pyromania from Project 2025 chief\b0\par\par\uc2 Lloyd Green \par \uc2 1,026 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 November 2024\par 13:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Head of Heritage Foundation wants to burn it all down in his new book and won\u8217\'20\'19t shut up about it\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe aim of this book is to confront our present situation, to inspire the New Conservative Movement to rekindle the fire of the American tradition, and to empower real Americans to take back our country,\u8221\'20\'1D Kevin Roberts, the president of \uc2 the Heritage Foundation\uc2  and chief architect of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/project-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Project 2025 }}}\uc2 , writes in his new book.\par \par \uc2 What he means by \u8220\'20\'1Creal Americans\u8221\'20\'1D is easily surmised.\par \par \uc2 JD Vance, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump }}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s vice-president elect, wrote the foreword to Roberts\u8217\'20\'19 book. Trump denied knowing who was behind Project 2025 \u8211\'20\'13 the vast and vastly controversial plan for a second Trump administration, full of hard-right policy and promised federal purges \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/elections/2024/08/07/trump-heritage-project-2025-roberts/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 until a photograph }}}\uc2  surfaced of him and Roberts on a plane grinning together.\par \par \uc2 In the immediate aftermath of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s re-election, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s former campaign chair and White House strategist \uc2 Steve Bannon{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newsweek.com/maga-project-2025-agenda-1981975"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enthusiastically embraced }}}\uc2  the words of Matt Walsh, a conservative political commentator: \u8220\'20\'1CNow that the election is over I think we can finally say that yeah actually Project 2025 is the agenda.\u8221\'20\'1D Of the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s reporting of Roberts\u8217\'20\'19s call in his book to \u8220\'20\'1Cburn\u8221\'20\'1D institutions including the \uc2 FBI\uc2 , the \uc2 New York Times\uc2  and for some reason the Boy Scouts, Bannon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/gc22gc/status/1854891701225316718?s=42"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented }}}\uc2  simply: \u8220\'20\'1CThe Hard Way\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Last June, Roberts told Bannon the US was set for a \u8220\'20\'1Csecond American revolution\u8221\'20\'1D, bloodless \u8220\'20\'1Cif the left allows it to be\u8221\'20\'1D. Controversy followed. Roberts\u8217\'20\'19s book was delayed. Now the election is done, it\u8217\'20\'19s here \u8211\'20\'13 and Roberts has little reason to worry.\par \par \uc2 His work for Heritage is about \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutionalizing Trumpism\u8221\'20\'1D. Even before Roberts arrived there in 2021, the foundation stoked allegations of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://electionfraud.heritage.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 election fraud }}}\uc2  with a dedicated website. Roberts does not believe \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  beat Trump in 2020. \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know the outcome,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/01/21/magazine/heritage-foundation-kevin-roberts.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he told the New York Times }}}\uc2 , adding: \u8220\'20\'1CI am no conspiracy theorist.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Of course not.\par \par \uc2 Some guesses as to Roberts\u8217\'20\'19s favorite records: Burning Down the House, by Talking Heads; Pyromaniac, by Def Leppard. In the 300 pages of Dawn\u8217\'20\'19s Early Light \u8211\'20\'13 original subtitle: \u8220\'20\'1CBurning Down Washington to Save America\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 the word \u8220\'20\'1Cfire\u8221\'20\'1D appears 109 times and \u8220\'20\'1Cburn\u8221\'20\'1D 40. Roberts wants a roaring pyre. He has the matches out for \uc2 Black Lives Matter\uc2  and the \uc2 Bureau of Land Management\uc2  too. He is amused that they share the same initials. The Federalist Papers, this isn\u8217\'20\'19t.\par \par \uc2 Roberts vibes weird, a cross between Spartacus and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.google.com/search?q=mc+900+ft+jesus+the+city+sleeps&oq=MC+900ft+jesus+&gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUqCAgCEAAYFhgeMgYIABBFGDkyCggBEC4YChgWGB4yCAgCEAAYFhgeMggIAxAAGBYYHjIICAQQABgWGB4yCAgFEAAYFhgeMggIBhAAGBYYHjIICAcQABgWGB4yCAgIEAAYFhge0gEINTEyNWowajmoAgCwAgA&sourceid=chrome&ie=UTF-8#wptab=si:ACC90nzcg09uT9dLCxMVYtMO0-0pjgQ_JR12fuxEIIyv63Ip94qTV1AYapsQRC_0ZtNEAZqspO61aR1kdWDOMAmRo2I2uAk7vCn-dHw67zP7Wy5VZkUCcyZcDHtj1y4b58a-bxE0lFkWCHtyGBE8ce4fMV200VjSYthlAAg5JIhCxUcpJZQylTo%3D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MC 900ft Jesus }}}\uc2 . He quotes Virgil: \u8220\'20\'1CMy spirit kindles to fire, and rises in wrath to avenge my dying land.\u8221\'20\'1D He doesn\u8217\'20\'19t actually quote the rapper also known as Mark Thomas Griffin \u8211\'20\'13 \u8220\'20\'1CEveryone has a little secret he keeps / I light the fires while the city sleeps\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 but you have to double-check he didn\u8217\'20\'19t. In Roberts\u8217\'20\'19s own words: \u8220\'20\'1CYou can\u8217\'20\'19t have a blaze without some kind of sacrificial transformation.\u8221\'20\'1D OK.\par \par \uc2 Silent about January 6, Roberts embraces \u8220\'20\'1Cordered liberty\u8221\'20\'1D as an alternative to the rule of law and personal autonomy. He begrudges contraception and derides dating apps. He is hostile toward \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COrdered liberty demands that each citizen cultivate within themselves an ethic of responsibility for their own liberty and that of the nation,\u8221\'20\'1D Roberts intones.\par \par \uc2 His ideal government \u8220\'20\'1Cencourages and promotes virtue\u8221\'20\'1D for \u8220\'20\'1Cupright citizens\u8221\'20\'1D but \u8220\'20\'1Cpunishes and corrects vice\u8221\'20\'1D that dwells within \u8220\'20\'1Ccriminals and scoundrels\u8221\'20\'1D. He advocates legislating morality. Deriding opposition from the right as \u8220\'20\'1Cwax museum conservatives\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 easily melted, presumably \u8211\'20\'13 he throws down the gauntlet: \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to bust up the Big Tech companies that have short-circuited our children\u8217\'20\'19s nervous systems, spread Chinese propaganda, and addicted millions of people to porn.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Good luck with that. Just for starters, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , Jeff Yass and Melania Trump might have something to say.\par \par \uc2 A South China Morning Post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3285468/china-elon-musks-rising-star-raises-hopes-us-engagement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 headline }}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CIn China, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rising star raises hopes for US engagement. Musk is well known in China and has been lauded for his investment in the country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Tariffs, anyone?\par \par \uc2 Then there\u8217\'20\'19s Yass and TikTok. \u8220\'20\'1CHow Jeff Yass Became One of the Most Influential Billionaires in the 2024 Election\u8221\'20\'1D, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/features/2024-06-24/jeff-yass-how-tiktok-billionaire-became-a-top-influence-in-2024-election?embedded-checkout=true"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg headline screamed }}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThe libertarian who turned Susquehanna into one of Wall Street\u8217\'20\'19s most powerful trading firms is enmeshed with TikTok \u8211\'20\'13 and betting on Trump.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Yass bet right. After meeting him, Trump flip-flopped and opposes a TikTok ban. As he now sees it, \uc2 Facebook\uc2  is worse.\par \par \uc2 A pack of prospective Trump treasury secretaries are up to their wazoos in China investments. Trump himself maintained a bank account there.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/02/melania-trump-memoir-defends-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Melania has weighed in on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWhy should anyone other than the woman herself have the power to determine what she does with her own body? A woman\u8217\'20\'19s fundamental right of individual liberty, to her own life, grants her the authority to terminate her pregnancy if she wishes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Plenty of Trump voters in Florida, Arizona and Missouri agree. Not Roberts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/21pdf/19-1392_6j37.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs }}}\uc2  [the 2022 supreme court ruling which gutted the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ] did was finally return to the pro-life movement the right to fight for the unborn on a level playing field again,\u8221\'20\'1D Roberts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.heritage.org/life/commentary/the-reopening-the-american-heart"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says }}}\uc2 . Talk about false modesty. Dobbs shredded a half-century of rulings that shielded personal privacy. Roberts also basks in the Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, which enlists citizens to snitch on neighbors.\par \par \uc2 Then again, Dobbs didn\u8217\'20\'19t just lead swaths of red America to embrace a woman\u8217\'20\'19s choice. It {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/22/upshot/abortions-rising-state-bans.html#:~:text=In%20nearly%20every%20state%20that,Wade."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spurred more abortions }}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/10/21/health/infant-deaths-increase-post-dobbs-abortion-bans/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 higher infant mortality rates }}}\uc2 . Unintended consequences, so it appears.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn nearly every state that has banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the number of women receiving abortions increased between 2020 and the end of 2023, according to the most comprehensive account of all abortions by state since the overturning of Roe v Wade,\u8221\'20\'1D the \uc2 New York Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/10/22/upshot/abortions-rising-state-bans.html#:~:text=In%20nearly%20every%20state%20that,Wade."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Roberts professes himself unbothered.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is time to fight fire with fire,\u8221\'20\'1D he writes. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_3eC35LoF4U"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 David Byrne and Talking Heads }}}\uc2  made that sort of thing sound way more fun.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Dawn\u8217\'20\'19s Early Light {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bookshop.org/p/books/turning-the-tide-kevin-roberts/21025142?ean=9780063353503"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is published }}}\uc2  in the US by \uc2 HarperCollins\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241117ekbh001ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
