\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Americans stockpile  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pills and hormones ahead of \u8216\'20\'18reproductive apocalypse\u8217\'20\'19 under Trump\b0\par\par\uc2 Emily Shugerman \par \uc2 1,070 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2024\par 14:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Healthcare providers report unprecedented demand for reproductive and gender-affirming medications: \u8216\'20\'18We\u8217\'20\'19ve never seen this before\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 When the presidential election results were handed down on Wednesday, Rebecca Gomperts, the founder of Aid Access, the No 1 supplier of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills by mail in the United States, was huddled in a Paris apartment with her team of eight American physicians and 15 support staff. The group \u8211\'20\'13 which usually operates remotely, shipping out more than 9,000 \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills a month \u8211\'20\'13 had convened in person before the election, knowing they might have to spring into action.\par \par \uc2 They were right: as news of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory spread, the website received more than 5,000 requests for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills in less than 12 hours \u8211\'20\'13 a surge even larger than the day after Roe v Wade fell. \u8220\'20\'1CI can see all the new requests ticking in as we\u8217\'20\'19re talking,\u8221\'20\'1D Gomperts said in a phone call on Wednesday afternoon. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ve never seen this before.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The scenario repeated itself across the country as news of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s victory broke, with women\u8217\'20\'19s and trans health providers getting inundated with requests for services that their patients feared might be banned in a Trump administration. The telehealth service Wisp saw a 300% increase in requests for emergency contraception; the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill finder site Plan C saw a 625% increase in traffic.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CClearly, people are trying to plan for the reproductive apocalypse that we anticipate will be happening under a Trump presidency,\u8221\'20\'1D said Elisa Wells, the co-founder of Plan C.\par \par \uc2 We see what is coming, and we are protecting ourselves\par \par \uc2 Cynthia Plotch\par \par \uc2 For Gomperts and her team at Aid Access, the moment did not come as a shock: they\u8217\'20\'19d been preparing for it since the last Trump administration, when Gomperts, a Dutch physician, expanded her international \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill service into the United States. Since then, Aid Access has devised a system in which physicians in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal prescribe and ship \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to patients in states where it is not. The non-profit eventually expanded to the team of eight physicians in four states, along with a help desk that is available 24/7.\par \par \uc2 But the scale of the demand on Wednesday \u8211\'20\'13 five times more than a usual day \u8211\'20\'13 was shocking even to them.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have an extremely streamlined process and we are capable of dealing with all the requests really fast,\u8221\'20\'1D Gomperts said. \u8220\'20\'1CBut it\u8217\'20\'19s much more [than usual]. And I think the reason is people are now much more aware \u8211\'20\'13 people are aware of the possibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill and aware of the threat it will be taken off the market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump has flip-flopped on the prospect of a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, at one point saying women who obtain abortions illegally should be punished, and at others saying the decision should be left up to the states. But his supreme court appointments paved the way for the overturning of Roe in 2022, and his appointments to other, lower courts have held up even the strictest of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans in red states like Texas. There are also multiple ways he could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://slate.com/news-and-politics/2024/11/trump-second-term-abortion-agenda-blue-state-crackdown.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 go after the prescribing }}}\uc2  and shipping of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, which now account for the majority of abortions in the US.\par \par \uc2 The panic didn\u8217\'20\'19t just extend to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills. The online women\u8217\'20\'19s health provider Wisp told the Guardian it had already tripled its usual daily sales of emergency contraception by 11.30am on Wednesday. It also saw a huge increase in orders of bulk Plan B packs, which went from about 30% of their emergency contraceptive orders earlier in the month to nearly 90% on Wednesday. New patient requests for Plan B also soared from 50% of their orders to 70%.\par \par \uc2 The telehealth site Hey Jane said requests for birth control had doubled, and Winx, a similar women\u8217\'20\'19s health service, said it had sold six times as many doses of Plan B by Wednesday afternoon as it had in the past seven days combined.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWomen are smart,\u8221\'20\'1D Winx co-founder Cynthia Plotch said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe see what is coming, and we are protecting ourselves.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Dr Crystal Beal, meanwhile, was dealing with an influx of emails on Wednesday from trans patients concerned about their access to hormones and hormone-blocking therapy. Beal runs a site called QueerDoc, which provides estrogen, testosterone and hormone-blocking drugs. Trump is hostile to trans rights, vowing to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/trump-vows-stop-gender-affirming-care-minors-re-elected-president-rcna68461"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 punish doctors }}}\uc2  who provide gender-affirming care to minors, and Beal\u8217\'20\'19s patients wanted to know how to protect themselves from a second Trump administration.\par \par \uc2 By early on Wednesday afternoon, QueerDoc had already received more messages that day than it would in a typical week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSome of it is \u8216\'20\'18How can I safeguard my access to medication?\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D Beal said. \u8220\'20\'1CSome of it is \u8216\'20\'18Should I change [the gender on] my legal documents back so I\u8217\'20\'19m safer? Should I stop taking medication so I\u8217\'20\'19m safer?\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Beal said the service was advising patients to stock up on as much of their hormone treatment as state law and their insurance coverage allowed, and even suggesting trans men reuse single-use vials of testosterone to make them stretch farther. When it came to stopping medication or changing paperwork, Beal said, that was a more personal question.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have to tell people I ultimately can\u8217\'20\'19t predict the future or make that choice or decision for them, and I certainly can\u8217\'20\'19t give legal advice,\u8221\'20\'1D Beal said. \u8220\'20\'1CBut changing your documentation or stopping your medication does not make you any less of a man or a woman, or any less trans. Who we are is not designated by what our documents say or what medications we take.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 QueerDoc sent a message to its patients on Wednesday morning reminding them that while they were worried about the future, \u8220\'20\'1Ctrans people have always been here, and we will continue to persist\u8221\'20\'1D, Beal said. And all of the providers who spoke to the \uc2 Guardian\uc2  urged patients not to panic and said they would keep providing services until the day they legally could not \u8211\'20\'13 and in some cases, even after that.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSomeone gave us a donation today with the message \u8216\'20\'18Don\u8217\'20\'19t let the bastards get you down,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D said Wells. \u8220\'20\'1CPoliticians are not going to stop access, and they\u8217\'20\'19re not going to stop us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241107ekb7001s3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
