\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Where do Harris and Trump stand on the key election issues?\b0\par\par\uc2 Lauren Gambino \par \uc2 2,681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2024\par 13:41 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 From \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the economy, the Democrat and Republican have widely diverging visions for the country\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  offer two starkly different visions for the country with much at stake \u8211\'20\'13 from pocketbook economic issues and \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the strength of the country\u8217\'20\'19s global alliances and existential questions about the future of American democracy and the planet.\par \par \uc2 As they compete for the White House, both candidates have laid out their plans in speeches, campaign ads and media interviews. Most of it amounts to a wish list, sketched out in broad strokes and lacking concrete details about how they would be implemented or paid for. A number of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s proposals raise legal questions, while some of Harris\u8217\'20\'19s would probably require Democratic control of Congress.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  policies on the economy\par \par \uc2 On the top issue for voters this election, Harris is tied to the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s record on the economy \u8211\'20\'13 for better or worse. But she has proposed her own set of targeted economic plans to lower costs.\par \par \uc2 Inflation: While the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/may/16/dow-jones-record-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overall economic picture}}}\uc2  has brightened in recent months, Harris has said she agrees with Americans that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/25/harris-opportunity-economic-plan-middle-class"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prices are \u8220\'20\'1Cstill too high\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  after several years of significant inflation. Harris says she wants to build up the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/16/kamala-harris-economy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Copportunity economy,\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 , focused on the middle class, with plans to combat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/14/kamala-harris-economic-policy-aides"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price gouging}}}\uc2 , boost housing development, aid first-time homebuyers, expand tax credits for parents and expand Medicare to cover {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/harris-home-health-care-sandwhich-generation-098a7ed48dfd94d11fb0efcd5d63b42b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in-home senior care}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Taxes: Harris has pledged to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/16/kamala-harris-economy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cut taxes }}}\uc2  for tens of millions of middle- and low-income families, while saying she supports {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/antoniopequenoiv/2024/09/04/harris-proposes-50000-small-business-tax-deduction-for-startup-expenses-heres-what-to-know/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tax breaks}}}\uc2  for entrepreneurs and small business owners. She also backs a proposal championed by Trump to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/10/harris-walz-las-vegas-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eliminate taxes on tips}}}\uc2 . Harris has called for the corporate tax rate to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/business/4835444-harris-proposes-corporate-tax-increase/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised to 28%}}}\uc2 , up from 21%.\par \par \uc2 Trade: Harris is expected to maintain the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s approach, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/article/2024/may/14/joe-biden-tariff-chinese-made-electric-vehicles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relying on tariffs}}}\uc2  and export controls to boost domestic competitiveness with China. On the campaign trail, she has also touted the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s ambitious investments in infrastructure and renewable energy.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  policies on the economy\par \par \uc2 Trump continues to tout his pre-pandemic record.\par \par \uc2 Inflation: Much of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s inflation-reduction plan hinges on his vow to slash energy costs by expanding oil and gas drilling and deregulation, though {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/15/trump-economy-inflation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 economists say}}}\uc2  his plans for sweeping tariffs and mass deportations could actually raise costs. He has also been highly critical of high interest rates, the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s main inflation-fighting tool. Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-08-08/trump-wants-presidents-to-have-some-say-over-fed-policy?sref=fqqmZ8gi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  recently that he thinks the president should have a say in decisions made by the Fed, which traditionally operates independently from politics.\par \par \uc2 Taxes: In a second term, he has vowed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/tariffs-tax-cuts-core-trumps-economic-pitch-voters-2024-09-24/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extend and expand}}}\uc2  a suite of tax cuts he signed into law in 2017, while pledging to cut the corporate tax rate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-09-05/trump-vows-15-corporate-tax-and-taps-musk-for-federal-audit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to 15% from 21%}}}\uc2  for companies that make their products in the US. He has also said he would exempt {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/social-security-tax-trump-election-2024-9f911216"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Social Security benefits}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/trump-taxes-social-security-overtime-tariffs-989016ef41dc1533b05d1871d69c03ff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 and overtime pay}}}\uc2 , in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/09/trump-las-vegas-rally-heat-medics"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 addition to tips}}}\uc2 , from income taxes.\par \par \uc2 Trade and tariffs: Trump has called himself as the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/realDonaldTrump/status/1069970500535902208"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tariff man}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D, casting such taxes as the answer to the country\u8217\'20\'19s myriad economic problems, from revitalizing a sagging auto industry to bringing down the high cost of childcare. The former president has suggested an across-the-board {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/markets/us/trumps-plan-hike-tariffs-would-spike-shipping-costs-just-like-2018-experts-say-2024-09-12/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 levy}}}\uc2  of perhaps 10% and up to 20% on virtually all foreign-made goods, as well as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2024/02/04/trump-floats-more-than-60percent-tariffs-on-chinese-imports.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 slapping tariffs of 60%}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 or more \u8211\'20\'13 on goods from China, an approach the Economist called a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.economist.com/finance-and-economics/2023/10/31/donald-trumps-second-term-would-be-a-protectionist-nightmare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protectionist nightmare}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D. He has said he would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cfr.org/blog/election-2024-donald-trump-has-vowed-raise-tariffs-can-he"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  ask Congress}}}\uc2  for the authority to impose a reciprocal tariff on any country that imposes one on the US.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  policies on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Harris was a vocal proponent of \b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  before she became the nominee, assailing Trump and Republicans for creating a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/24/biden-abortion-roe-dobbs-ad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Chealthcare crisis\u8221\'20\'1D }}}\uc2  that has led to the preventable {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/17/harris-trump-georgia-abortion-death-amber-nicole-thurman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deaths of women seeking \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  care}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Roe v Wade and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans: As a candidate, she has called on Congress to pass legislation to restore the protections of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade,}}}\uc2  which the supreme court overturned in 2022. Doing so would reinstate the Roe-era status quo, in effect blocking states from banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  before fetal viability, or about 24 weeks of pregnancy. As president, Harris has vowed she would veto any nationwide \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 IVF: Harris has pledged to protect the full spectrum of reproductive healthcare, including access to contraception and other fertility treatments such as in vitro fertilization ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/ivf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IVF}}}\uc2  ). She has also touted efforts by the Biden-Harris administration to safeguard access to medical \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and protect women who cross state lines to access the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  policies on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Trump has alternately bragged about his role appointing three {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supreme court }}}\uc2  justices whose votes were decisive in overturning Roe while also complaining that bans on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Republican-controlled states may hurt him electorally.\par \par \uc2 Roe v\par \par \uc2 Wade and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans: Trump has said \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access should be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/08/trump-abortion-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 left to the states}}}\uc2 , and has vowed that as president he would not sign a national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. (Weeks before making that pledge, he refused to say whether he would veto such a ban.)\par \par \uc2 IVF: He has also said that if he wins he would make IVF free for women, though has provided few specifics and Republicans in Congress have repeatedly blocked legislation that would protect the treatment.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/project-2025-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Project 2025,}}}\uc2  the 900-page conservative blueprint for the next Republican president, suggests using a 19th-century anti-vice law to ban the mailing of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, which account for two-thirds of US abortions. Because this law is already on the books, a President Trump could enforce it without congressional action. Trump has said \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-insults-harris-intelligence-medical-records-tv-exclusive/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 generally speaking}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D he would not enforce the law, but had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2024/08/08/trump-abortion-pill-mifepristone-news-conference/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  previously expressed}}}\uc2  an openness to curbing access.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  policies on democracy\par \par \uc2 Harris has called Trump a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/23/harris-trump-fascist-hitler-comments-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fascist}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D seeking a return to \u8220\'20\'1Cunchecked power\u8221\'20\'1D. She staged her closing argument at the Ellipse, the precise spot from which Trump had fomented a violent assault on the US Capitol on 6 January 2021. Harris has warned that Trump would arrive in office with an \u8220\'20\'1Cenemies list\u8221\'20\'1D and has called his violent rhetoric against political opponents \u8220\'20\'1Cdisqualifying\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Reform: Harris has said that she is willing to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/24/election-harris-filibuster-abortion-roe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eliminate the filibuster}}}\uc2  to codify \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, a reform many Democrats believe would help ease some of the legislative gridlock in Congress.\par \par \uc2 Voting rights: As vice-president, she led the push to pass federal voting rights legislation, but the effort stalled.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  policies on democracy\par \par \uc2 Election denialism: Trump has never stopped fully repeating the lie that his 2020 presidential election loss to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden}}}\uc2  was marred by fraud. He has refused to say whether he would accept the results of the 2024 election, and he and his allies are already laying the groundwork to deny an electoral defeat. In comments that have alarmed experts and scholars, Trump has threatened to jail his political opponents and turn the military against US citizens. He has also pledged to pardon defendants convicted for their roles in the January 6 attack, which he recently called a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2024/10/29/nx-s1-5159868/2024-election-trump-harris-capitol-riot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 day of love}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Trump, meanwhile, is facing federal charges over his attempt to overturn the results of the election, including his actions related to the violent Capitol assault. Trump, who has signaled his intention to surround himself with loyalists, has said he would retaliate against his political opponents, threatening to use the justice department to prosecute {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/realDonaldTrump/status/1832589096029450360"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Democratic lawyers}}}\uc2 , elections officials, donors and even voters. This would be a sharp break from Democratic norms in the United States, where federal law enforcement is supposed to be apolitical.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  policies on border security\par \par \uc2 and immigration\par \par \uc2 Harris has sought to flip the script on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/usimmigration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 immigration}}}\uc2 , one of her biggest political vulnerabilities.\par \par \uc2 Border security: During a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/27/harris-immigration-border-visit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 visit to the border in September}}}\uc2 , she laid out a plan to enact stricter penalties for people who attempt to claim asylum between lawful ports of entry. Arrests of people for crossing the southern border reached record levels during the early years of the Biden administration, but have fallen sharply since he implemented an asylum clampdown. As vice-president, Harris was tasked with addressing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/jul/11/kamala-harris-first-six-months-vice-president-joe-biden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 root causes of migration}}}\uc2 . Trump and Republicans blame her for the situation at the border, describing it as overrun as a result of Biden\u8217\'20\'19s overly lenient immigration policies.\par \par \uc2 Immigration reform: A former California senator, Harris has long championed comprehensive immigration reform, including pathways to citizenship for undocumented immigrants, especially those who were brought to the US as children.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  policies on border security\par \par \uc2 and immigration\par \par \uc2 Immigration is Trump\u8217\'20\'19s signature issue. In a second term, he has vowed to go much further than he did four years ago.\par \par \uc2 Deportation: He has promised to carry out the largest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/may/03/trump-mass-deportations-detention-camps-military-migrants"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 domestic deportation}}}\uc2  operation in US history, a policy that would face logistical, legal and financial hurdles while tearing apart families and unleashing fear throughout immigrant communities. He has said he would reinstate several controversial policies from his first term, including the Remain in Mexico program, Title 42 and a travel ban targeting several Muslim-majority nations. He has vowed to rescind programs that shield undocumented immigrants from deportation, including children, while revoking the legal status of potentially hundreds of thousands of immigrants in the US under the federal temporary protected status program. Trump has also suggested he would end birthright citizenship for the US-born children of undocumented immigrants \u8211\'20\'13 a proposal that experts say is unlikely to prevail in court \u8211\'20\'13 and impose \u8220\'20\'1Cideological screenings\u8221\'20\'1D for immigrants.\par \par \uc2 Anti-immigrant sentiment: Beyond his policy, Trump has used his rhetoric to stoke fear of immigrants, claiming that the country was being \u8220\'20\'1Cinvaded\u8221\'20\'1D and amplifying rightwing lies about immigrant populations in places like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/20/mike-dewine-ohio-trump-vance-haitian-immigrants"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Springfield, Ohio}}}\uc2 , where Haitians have become targets of threats and vitriol since the former president repeated a false rumor about the community. He has also echoed Adolf Hitler, saying that immigrants coming to the US were \u8220\'20\'1Cpoisoning the blood of our country\u8221\'20\'1D. He recently said record levels of migration under the Biden administration had turned the US into a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/24/trump-arizona-rally-immigration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 garbage can}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  on foreign\par \par \uc2 policy\par \par \uc2 Global alliances: Harris\u8217\'20\'19s approach to foreign policy has hewed closely to the president\u8217\'20\'19s, with an emphasis on maintaining the US\u8217\'20\'19s global alliances, especially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/nato"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nato}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Russia-Ukraine war: She has fully aligned herself with the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s response to Russia\u8217\'20\'19s invasion of Ukraine nearly three years ago, pledging unyielding support for the nation as it battles to repel Russian forces from its territory. Harris has repeatedly attacked Putin\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cbrutality\u8221\'20\'1D and warned that Trump would force Ukraine to \u8220\'20\'1Csurrender\u8221\'20\'1D to Russia.\par \par \uc2 Middle East crisis: In the Middle East, Harris again has been broadly supportive of the administration\u8217\'20\'19s approach to Israel\u8217\'20\'19s widening war, which began in Gaza and now includes Lebanon, Yemen and Iran. Like Biden, Harris has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jul/26/kamala-harris-benjamin-netanyahu-us-visit-palestine-israel-gaza-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called for a ceasefire}}}\uc2  in Gaza in exchange for the release of hostages taken by \uc2 Hamas\uc2  on 7 October 2023. Harris has repeatedly said the US will always support Israel\u8217\'20\'19s right to defend itself, and has rebuffed activist calls to support an arms embargo on the country. However, she has been more vocally critical of Israel\u8217\'20\'19s conduct during the yearlong conflict that has killed 43,000 Palestinians and deeply divided her party. She supports a two-state solution, with an independent Palestinian state.\par \par \uc2 China: She has signaled a continuation of Biden\u8217\'20\'19s tough-on-China approach and has said she would honor the US\u8217\'20\'19s commitments to Taiwan.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  on foreign policy\par \par \uc2 Trump, who shares isolationist impulses, has repeatedly said that the world was a more peaceful place when he was in power.\par \par \uc2 Global alliances: He has long been a skeptic of global alliances. \uc2 Nato\uc2  continues to be a top target of his disdain \u8211\'20\'13 he once said he would \u8220\'20\'1Cencourage\u8221\'20\'1D Russia to invade a member country if it wasn\u8217\'20\'19t paying enough. He has not ruled out withdrawing from \uc2 Nato\uc2 , and even suggested he might step back from other alliances.\par \par \uc2 Russia-Ukraine war: With many of his supporters opposed to continuing the flow of US aid to Ukraine, Trump has vowed to \u8220\'20\'1Cfundamentally re-evaluate\u8221\'20\'1D the country\u8217\'20\'19s approach. He has claimed that he will end the nearly three-year war on his first day in office, but offered no details on how he might accomplish this. During the presidential debate, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/sep/11/us-presidential-debate-donald-trump-ukraine-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refused to say}}}\uc2  whether he wanted Ukraine to win the war. His flattery of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/vladimir-putin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vladimir Putin}}}\uc2  and complicated history with Ukraine \u8211\'20\'13 he was impeached in 2019 for withholding aid as a means of pressuring his president for \u8220\'20\'1Cdirt\u8221\'20\'1D on Biden \u8211\'20\'13 suggest the proposal would probably entail Ukraine giving up some of its territory captured by Russia.\par \par \uc2 Middle East crisis: Trump has long cast himself as a champion of Israel, despite a long history of antisemitic remarks. Though he says he supports Israel\u8217\'20\'19s mission, he has been critical of its tactics and has tangled with its leader, the rightwing prime minister, \uc2 Benjamin Netanyahu\uc2 . At home, he has advocated for an aggressive response to pro-Palestinian protests, suggesting he would strip foreign students of their visas if they express antisemitic or anti-American sentiment.\par \par \uc2 China: In a second term, Trump has said he would take an even stronger stand against China, though he has praised its president, Xi Jinping, and has not said whether he would send troops if China invaded Taiwan.\par \par \uc2 * * *\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\par \par \uc2 on climate\par \par \uc2 and energy policies\par \par \uc2 Harris has said unequivocally that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/climate-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climate crisis}}}\uc2  is caused by human activity and represents an existential threat to the nation and the planet.\par \par \uc2 Climate programs: As vice-president, Harris cast the tie-breaking vote to pass the Biden-Harris administration\u8217\'20\'19s signature {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/aug/11/biden-climate-bill-inflation-reduction-act"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Inflation Reduction Act}}}\uc2  legislation that marked the country\u8217\'20\'19s most significant effort yet to combat the climate crisis. The law made major investments in renewable energy as part of the administration\u8217\'20\'19s overall aim to dramatically reduce the US\u8217\'20\'19s planet-heating emissions by the end of the decade. But it also expanded planet-heating fossil fuels \u8211\'20\'13 something Harris touted in her September debate with Trump \u8211\'20\'13 and under Biden, Harris also presided over record-high US oil and gas production.\par \par \uc2 Harris has walked back her support for the progressive Green New Deal proposal and a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2024/sep/11/fracking-debate-explained-debate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fracking ban}}}\uc2 . She is a proponent of electric vehicles \u8211\'20\'13 though does not support a mandate \u8211\'20\'13 and backs clean-energy tax credits, and has promoted climate justice programs, focused on protecting \u8220\'20\'1Cfrontline\u8221\'20\'1D communities from the impacts of the climate crisis.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\par \par \uc2 on climate\par \par \uc2 and energy policies\par \par \uc2 Trump has questioned established climate science, previously dismissing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/oct/02/donald-trump-climate-change-michael-mann-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climate crisis}}}\uc2  as \u8220\'20\'1Cmythical\u8221\'20\'1D and an \u8220\'20\'1Cexpensive hoax\u8221\'20\'1D. He has also said that the warming climate is not necessarily responsible for making extreme weather events worse. On the campaign trail, he has summed up his position with the declaration: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jun/10/trump-rallies-extreme-heat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDrill, baby, drill.\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\par \par \uc2 Environmental regulations: As president, Trump claims he will prioritize clean air and water for Americans. Yet he has also promised to continue to roll back environmental regulations, including all of the ones put in place by the Biden administration.\par \par \uc2 Oil and gas: In a May meeting with oil bosses, he reportedly offered to dismantle Biden\u8217\'20\'19s environmental rules and requested $1bn in contributions to his presidential campaign. During his first term, he dismantled many environmental policies, including protections for clean air and water as well as regulations aimed at reducing planet-warming emissions. He is especially opposed to wind power \u8211\'20\'13 falsely claiming wind turbines are a major threat to birds, cause cancer and \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/sep/26/trump-whale-wind-turbine-renewable-energy-misinformation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drive the whales crazy}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Read more of the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s 2024 US election coverage\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/04/when-do-polls-close-election-day"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 When do polls close}}}\uc2  ?\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/05/harris-trump-election-results-when"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 When will we know the result?}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/abortion-ballot-results-tracker-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Where is \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  on the ballot?}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/us-senate-house-and-governor-elections-2024-results-from-all-50-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Senate, House and governor results}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/03/us-presidential-election-trump-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Everything you need to know}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 This article was amended on 8 November 2024. An earlier version said that it was false to claim that wind turbines kill birds. In fact they do, but they are not a major threat to their existence.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241103ekb30010d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
