\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Red\u8217\'20\'19 US states pass progressive laws while \u8216\'20\'18blue\u8217\'20\'19 states vote for conservative measures\b0\par\par\uc2 Victoria Bekiempis and Dharna Noor \par \uc2 621 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 November 2024\par 04:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Missouri, which voted for Trump, backed increasing minimum wage, while blue California said yes for a tough-on-crime propositionUS election results 2024: live map and trackerUS election 2024 \u8211\'20\'13 live news updates\par \par \uc2 While {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump }}}\uc2  comfortably cruised to victory over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris }}}\uc2 , , voters in a handful of red states cast their ballots for policies {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/abortion-ballot-results-tracker-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 favored }}}\uc2  by centrists and progressives \u8211\'20\'13 such as minimum wage protections.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile voters in some deep-blue states favored measures that are conventionally associated with conservatism, such as tough-on-crime initiatives.\par \par \uc2 These outcomes to some extent also undermine the notions of monolithic \u8220\'20\'1Cred states\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cblue states\u8221\'20\'1D. Voters in 2024 repeatedly cited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/oct/22/harris-working-class-voters-poll-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 economic woes }}}\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as among their top issues, and approved of certain progressive or conservative policies even when they didn\u8217\'20\'19t like candidates associated with them.\par \par \uc2 Missouri is among the most striking examples. Trump won this midwestern state\u8217\'20\'19s 10 electoral votes after receiving 1,739,020 ballots, compared with Harris\u8217\'20\'19s 1,190,806 \u8211\'20\'13 a landslide 58.5%.\par \par \uc2 But Missouri also also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kansascity.com/news/politics-government/article294530839.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 green lit }}}\uc2  a union-backed ballot initiative to increase the state\u8217\'20\'19s minimum wage to $15 an hour by January 2026. This initiative also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/election-harris-loss-labor-unions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provides }}}\uc2  paid sick leave to workers of large employers.\par \par \uc2 And voters overturned the state\u8217\'20\'19s near-total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, establishing a constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  until fetal viability.\par \par \uc2 Alaska, which awarded its three electoral votes to Trump, approved a ballot measure to raise the state minimum wage to an hourly $15 by 2027.\par \par \uc2 Voters in Arizona, which at press time is poised to hand its 11 electoral votes to Trump, OK\u8217\'20\'19d a ballot measure to create a fundamental right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The measure prohibits the state from restricting or banning it before 24 weeks.\par \par \uc2 Results were equally striking in Montana, which saw Trump best Harris 59.1% to 37.9% at press time. Almost the same amount \u8211\'20\'13 57.1% voting yes and 42.9% no, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-elections/ballot-measures#marijuana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to NBC News }}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 elected to amend the state constitution to clearly include \u8220\'20\'1Ca right to make and carry out decisions about one\u8217\'20\'19s own pregnancy\u8221\'20\'1D. This includes \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access until fetal viability, which is generally around 24 weeks.\par \par \uc2 In several heavily Democratic states, voters indicated that they weren\u8217\'20\'19t all-in for progressivism. In California, residents voted in favor of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/03/kamala-harris-proposition-36-drug-theft-crimes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Proposition 36 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This ballot initiative enacts harsher punishments for retail theft, drug offenses and property crimes. The proposition revamps portions of a watershed 2014 law that downgraded several non-violent felony charges to misdemeanor charges.\par \par \uc2 That earlier initiative was meant to reduce the number of incarcerated people in California\u8217\'20\'19s prisons and shift money to drug treatment and resources for crime victims. Supporters saw it as a major win for criminal justice reform, but others said it led to increased property and drug crimes, as well as homelessness.\par \par \uc2 Proposition 36 enjoyed support from numerous law enforcement and business organizations, as well as conservatives and some Democratic mayors, such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/san-francisco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 San Francisco\u8217\'20\'19s }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/22/inside-san-franciscos-brutal-and-expensive-race-for-mayor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 London Breed }}}\uc2 . It aimed at tackling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/22/los-angeles-unhoused-deaths-increase-housing-crisis-fentanyl-overdoses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 homelessness and fentanyl abuse,  }}}\uc2  with longer prison sentences for dealers and court-mandated drug treatment.\par \par \uc2 Massachusetts voters have struck down a proposal to increase tipped employees\u8217\'20\'19 wages. The measure would have incrementally increased tipped workers\u8217\'20\'19 wages until reaching the state minimum wage in 2029, while still allowing tipping, NBC News {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-elections/ballot-measures#elections-voting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Read more of the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s 2024 US election coverage\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/kamala-harris-concession-speech"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Harris urges supporters to \u8216\'20\'18never give up\u8217\'20\'19 }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/06/election-trump-harris-democrats-loss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats ask: \u8216\'20\'18How do you spend $1bn and not win?\u8217\'20\'19 }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/06/the-key-swings-that-handed-trump-the-white-house-a-visual-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How Trump won the presidency \u8211\'20\'13 in maps }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2024/nov/06/jon-stewart-trump-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jon Stewart: \u8216\'20\'18This is not the end\u8217\'20\'19 }}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/06/donald-trump-wins-election-11-issues-threat"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 With Trump re-elected, this is what\u8217\'20\'19s at stake }}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241106ekb6003ec\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
