\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18I try not to get my hopes up\u8217\'20\'19: campaigners make final push to save  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights in Florida\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman in Tampa \par \uc2 950 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 November 2024\par 14:27 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Amendment 4, which would enshrine the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state constitution, must garner 60% of votes to pass\par \par \uc2 As she stood in the parking lot of an auto supply store on Friday evening, Brittany Robinson was practically vibrating. With just a few days left before the 2024 presidential elections, the 32-year-old Floridian needed an outlet for her anxiety.\par \par \uc2 So Robinson decided to go knock on strangers\u8217\'20\'19 doors in support of Amendment 4, a ballot measure that, if passed, would enshrine \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights into Florida\u8217\'20\'19s constitution and overturn the state\u8217\'20\'19s six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI wish I started earlier,\u8221\'20\'1D said Robinson, a native of the Tampa Bay area who had never before canvassed for a political campaign. Living under Florida\u8217\'20\'19s ban, she said, is \u8220\'20\'1Cterrifying\u8221\'20\'1D. When she was a freshman in college 13 years ago, Robinson discovered she was seven weeks pregnant and had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  a week later.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have been able to do that now,\u8221\'20\'1D Robinson said.\par \par \uc2 Come Tuesday, Florida will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/26/election-abortion-ballot-measures-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one of 10 states}}}\uc2  where voters will have the chance to amend their state constitution to add or expand \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. Of all those measures, the battle in Florida may be the most intense \u8211\'20\'13 and the most uphill for supporters of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 Florida has taken a sharp turn towards the right in recent years, and its hardline conservative government has effectively launched a war against the Amendment 4 campaign.\par \par \uc2 Amendment 4 needs to garner 60% of the vote to pass. Although \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights advocates have won every post-Roe v Wade \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ballot measure in the US, none have hit that threshold.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI am extremely confident that the people of Florida want Amendment 4 to be passed,\u8221\'20\'1D said Laura Shaw, a 21-year-old working on the campaign. \u8220\'20\'1CHowever, I am also all too aware of the steps that the Florida government is taking to suppress those ideas.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In the last days before the election, nothing seemed certain.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know what to think,\u8221\'20\'1D said Sanderlyne St Cyr, a 20-year-old who voted early for Amendment 4. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m just going to sit back and observe and let Jesus take the wheel.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Over the last several weeks, Florida law enforcement has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/13/florida-abortion-petition-investigation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investigated people who signed a petition}}}\uc2  to get the measure on the ballot, while the health department sent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/09/florida-news-abortion-ballot-coverage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cease-and-desist letters}}}\uc2  to local TV stations that aired an ad supporting it. ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/18/florida-abortion-ad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights activists sued}}}\uc2  and won.) Florida\u8217\'20\'19s Republican governor, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , has also claimed that Amendment 4 would eliminate a law that requires Florida minors to obtain parental consent before getting an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 a claim {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/oct/28/abortion-rights-parental-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legal experts say is overblown}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While canvassing, Makenzie Martin, a 23-year-old organizer with the campaign for Amendment 4, has run into people who wrongly believe that the measure \u8211\'20\'13 which would protect the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  until viability, or about 24 weeks \u8211\'20\'13 would allow abortions into the ninth month of pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 One woman, Martin said, thought \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights activists wanted to allow doctors to perform abortions after birth \u8211\'20\'13 a wildly inaccurate talking point that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has raised repeatedly in presidential debates. (That would be murder and it is already illegal.)\par \par \uc2 There are now more than 1 million more registered Republicans in Florida than Democrats, which means that in order to pass, the nonpartisan campaign for Amendment 4 will probably need to secure the votes of a sizable swath of Trump supporters.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fau.edu/newsdesk/articles/oct24nationalandflapoll"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 One recent poll}}}\uc2  found that 58% of Florida voters supported Amendment 4, while 34% opposed it. Six per cent were undecided.\par \par \uc2 Instructions handed out to canvassers advise them not to respond to any comments about candidates and to emphasize how the amendment would \u8220\'20\'1Ckick ALL POLITICIANS, regardless of their party affiliation, out of private medical decisions\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The instructions also suggest that canvassers ignore public polls and claim that most of them have been surveying people \u8220\'20\'1Cin ways that are highly misleading\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 As she knocked on doors in one Tampa neighborhood on Friday evening, Martin had little luck getting voters to answer. Although one woman heartily agreed with Amendment 4 \u8211\'20\'13 \u8220\'20\'1CYou never know what a woman is going through!\u8221\'20\'1D she shouted from her yard at Martin, adding: \u8220\'20\'1CShe could have gotten raped!\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 Martin more often ended up just tucking purplish brochures about the measure into houses\u8217\'20\'19 chain-link fences.\par \par \uc2 Robinson, too, largely struck out. However, she was delighted to encounter a teenage girl at one house, who, Robinson said, excitedly endorsed Amendment 4.\par \par \uc2 Shaw had better luck earlier in the day, when she and other organizers set up a blue tent near an early voting site on the \uc2 University of Southern Florida\uc2 , Tampa, campus, where they handed out Amendment 4 merchandise and neon-colored boxes of emergency contraception. Several of the dozens of people who stopped by already knew about and supported Amendment 4. When Shaw tried to walk one woman through her pitch, the woman cut her off: \u8220\'20\'1CThis is to end the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, right?\u8221\'20\'1D She then unfurled a sample ballot; all she wanted was for Shaw to tell her how to vote yes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m a nurse, so I worry about my patients\u8217\'20\'19 rights too. My biggest thing with all my patients is: \u8216\'20\'18It\u8217\'20\'19s your body, it\u8217\'20\'19s your choice,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D said Lauren, who asked that her last name not be published due to her conservative workplace.\par \par \uc2 She\u8217\'20\'19s trying not to think about election day or what its outcome may be. \u8220\'20\'1CHonestly, I have no idea,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CI try not to get my hopes up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241102ekb2001p8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
