\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Judge strikes down Ohio  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban as unconstitutional\b0\par\par\uc2 Victoria Bekiempis \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2024\par 14:12 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Christian Jenkins rules \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  prohibition flouts language in state constitution that protects reproductive healthcare\par \par \uc2 An {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ohio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ohio}}}\uc2  judge has decided that the state\u8217\'20\'19s ban on most {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abortions}}}\uc2  was unconstitutional and could not be enforced.\par \par \uc2 Judge Christian Jenkins of the Hamilton county common pleas court also granted a permanent injunction in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.scribd.com/document/783942213/Preterm-Cleveland-v-Yost-Final-Ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his ruling}}}\uc2  on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Jenkins said that Ohio\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  prohibition flouted language in a voter-approved amendment to the state constitution that protected reproductive healthcare.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COhio voters have spoken. The Ohio constitution now unequivocally protects the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Jenkins {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dispatch.com/story/news/politics/2024/10/24/ohio-ban-on-most-abortions-ruled-unconstitutional/73195998007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in his ruling.\par \par \uc2 Jenkins\u8217\'20\'19s decision stems from a law that prohibited doctors from performing abortions after the detection of fetal cardiac or embryonic activity. This activity can be as early as six weeks into pregnancy, the Columbus Dispatch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dispatch.com/story/news/politics/elections/2023/11/06/ohio-issue-1-election-results-voters-decide-tuesday-on-abortion-ballot-issue/71226364007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While Republican lawmakers in Ohio passed this law in 2019, the legislation did not go into effect until June 2022 \u8211\'20\'13 when the \uc2 US supreme court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned}}}\uc2  Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 Jenkins temporarily paused the law less than three months after it went into effect. Healthcare providers in Ohio filed suit to permanently end the legislation, as it drove patients to seek reproductive care outside of the state and imperiled several clinics.\par \par \uc2 A young girl who was sexual assaulted in Columbus, Ohio, even had to travel to Indiana for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care, spurring still more anger over the measure.\par \par \uc2 Advocates launched a ballot initiative to ensure that reproductive healthcare rights, including \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , were protected by the state constitution. This campaign passed in November last year, winning 57% of voting Ohioans\u8217\'20\'19 support, the newspaper said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a momentous ruling, showing the power of Ohio\u8217\'20\'19s new Reproductive Freedom Amendment in practice,\u8221\'20\'1D Jessie Hill, cooperating attorney for the American Civil Liberties Union of Ohio, said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe six-week ban is blatantly unconstitutional and has no place in our law.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Jenkins\u8217\'20\'19 ruling came several months after another Ohio judge {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/23/ohio-24-hour-abortion-waiting-period-blocked"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 temporarily paused}}}\uc2  a handful of state laws that instituted a mandatory 24-hour waiting period for receiving an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 David C Young, the Franklin county common pleas judge who made this ruling in August, also said that the state constitutional amendment language protecting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \u8220\'20\'1Cclear and unambiguous.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Young ruled that lawyers for Preterm Cleveland and healthcare providers who had sued clearly demonstrated \u8220\'20\'1Cthat the challenged statutes burden, penalize, prohibit, interfere with, and discriminate against patients in exercising their right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and providers for assisting them in exercising that right\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The state\u8217\'20\'19s attorney general said he will appeal Young\u8217\'20\'19s ruling.\par \par \uc2 Jenkins\u8217\'20\'19 decision comes less than two weeks before the presidential {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-elections-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 election}}}\uc2 . Democratic candidate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kamala-harris"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris}}}\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/19/harris-abortion-rights-early-voting-atlanta"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 reproductive rights\b0 \highlight\uc2  a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/14/election-harris-trump-issues-policies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key component}}}\uc2  of her campaign.\par \par \uc2 Harris has repeatedly pointed out that \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  appointed three supreme court justices who voted to Roe v Wade. The former US president, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/22/gretchen-whitmer-calls-trump-deranged-after-comments-on-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 took credit}}}\uc2  for overturning Roe v Wade but recently toned down his language amid backlash, continues to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/25/us-presidential-election-trump-harris-updates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 poll far lower with women}}}\uc2  voters.\par \par \uc2 The Associated Press\par \par \uc2 contributed to this report\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241024ekao0035y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
