\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 The Satanic Temple is taking on the Christian right. It\u8217\'20\'19s fun to watch\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,251 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 October 2024\par 13:43 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Recognized as a religion by the IRS, the group uses the religious right\u8217\'20\'19s tactics, and their victories, against them\par \par \uc2 Satan is a feminist now\par \par \uc2 The devil works hard, but the Republican party works harder. Not a day seems to go by without anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  zealots on the right advancing some cunning new plan to strip women of their bodily autonomy. As well as shutting down \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics, Republican states are trying to essentially outlaw \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills: on Friday, Missouri, Kansas and Idaho renewed a legal push to drastically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/abortion-pill-mifespristone-state-lawsuit-f03bfe0d9b9fc04e4c8b01a1c6d16851"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduce access}}}\uc2  to mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 Amid this hellscape, help may be at hand from a somewhat unlikely source: Satan. Or, to be more accurate \u8211\'20\'13 and since the devil is in the details \u8211\'20\'13 the Satanic Temple.\par \par \uc2 Founded in 2012, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thesatanictemple.com/pages/about-us?srsltid=AfmBOoqwS4LBVNttUjQO10uj2fttdIeI0AaZ0BKoAME5ATZ7aM6tKdXD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Satanic Temple}}}\uc2  (which is not to be confused with the very different Church of Satan) is not about devil worship. Rather, it is about raising hell to fight for freedom from the religious right\u8217\'20\'19s crusade to impose their beliefs on everyone else. \u8220\'20\'1CRight now, we have a minority religious theocratic movement, so entrenched in politics and getting away with whatever they want,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/jan/04/friend-of-satan-how-lucien-greaves-and-his-satanic-temple-are-fighting-the-religious-right"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 co-founder Lucien Greaves}}}\uc2  told the Guardian earlier this year.\par \par \uc2 Recognized as a religion by the IRS, the Satanic Temple uses the religious right\u8217\'20\'19s tactics, and their victories, against them. When a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2013/dec/08/satan-ten-commandments-oklahoma-city"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ten Commandments monument}}}\uc2  was erected at the Oklahoma state capitol in 2012, for example, the temple submitted an application to put a 7ft-tall statue depicting Satan as Baphomet, a goat-headed figure with horns, alongside it. In its application, it argued that the decision to have a Ten Commandments monument paved the way for satanic representation. (They weren\u8217\'20\'19t the only ones protesting: the satirical Church of the Flying {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.spaghettimonster.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spaghetti Monster}}}\uc2  also requested a monument.) In the end, the Ten Commandments statue was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.aclu.org/press-releases/alabamas-chief-judge-ordered-remove-ten-commandments-monument-courthouse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 removed}}}\uc2  by order of the state\u8217\'20\'19s supreme court and the Horned One did not get immortalized in Oklahoma.\par \par \uc2 Over the years, the Satanic Temple has taken on issues like prayer in the classroom, after-class Bible study groups, and the distribution of Bibles in schools. Now, for obvious reasons, it\u8217\'20\'19s increasingly turning its not-so-evil eye to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. Last year, it opened an online \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic in New Mexico called The \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s Mom\u8217\'20\'19s Satanic \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Clinic, in reference to the conservative justice who wrote the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/abortion-us-supreme-court-health-samuel-alito-66c301d223759e842ad95e89f597d587"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 majority opinion}}}\uc2  that overturned Roe v Wade. \u8220\'20\'1CIn 1950, \uc2 Samuel Alito\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s mother did not have options, and look what happened,\u8221\'20\'1D Malcolm Jarry, co-founder of the Satanic Temple {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/the-satanic-temple-abortion-clinic-samuel-alito-b2282495.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said at the time}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As with its other causes, the Satanic Temple brands \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a core part of its religious beliefs. Women are asked to recite a ritual (\u8220\'20\'1CBy my body, my blood, by my will, it is done\u8221\'20\'1D) before taking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to ward off \u8220\'20\'1Cunjust persecution\u8221\'20\'1D. The temple has also sued states that have banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ag.idaho.gov/newsroom/labrador-letter-defeat-for-satanic-temple/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 arguing}}}\uc2  that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a religious rite for their congregation and that denying them access to these ritual abortions would be a constitutional violation.\par \par \uc2 All of this has had the desired effect of driving the satanists\u8217\'20\'19 adversaries bonkers. The Christian Research Institute, an evangelical group, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.economist.com/1843/2024/09/20/american-satanists-are-leading-the-fight-to-keep-abortion-legal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described the group}}}\uc2  as \u8220\'20\'1Ctroll lords\u8221\'20\'1D and said they were \u8220\'20\'1Cexploiting their cartoonishly dark and villainous branding to agitate the public and pester the Christian Right into a judicial showdown\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 That showdown may be forthcoming because the Satanic Temple {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thesatanictemple.com/blogs/news/introducing-right-to-your-life-satanic-abortion-clinic?srsltid=AfmBOoqxA323B3K554hiosFSKUeHdAiDwyQ7tAlAQeUMiajWR72HcSCL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has just opened}}}\uc2  its second telehealth \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic, this time in Virginia. It\u8217\'20\'19s called the Right to Your Life Satanic \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Clinic. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re also actively working to increase access in other states, including taking legal action in restrictive states such as Indiana and Idaho to provide religious \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  services there as well,\u8221\'20\'1D the temple {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thesatanictemple.com/blogs/news/introducing-right-to-your-life-satanic-abortion-clinic?srsltid=AfmBOoqxA323B3K554hiosFSKUeHdAiDwyQ7tAlAQeUMiajWR72HcSCL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in a statement}}}\uc2 . Truly, they are doing the Lord\u8217\'20\'19s work.\par \par \uc2 Russia wants to ban \u8216\'20\'18propaganda\u8217\'20\'19 promoting childfree lifestyles\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is important to protect people, primarily the younger generation, from having the ideology of childlessness imposed on them on the internet, in the media, in movies and in advertising,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/oct/18/russia-ban-propaganda-promoting-childfree-lifestyles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one politician said}}}\uc2 . I imagine that JD Vance, who has very strong views on \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2024/sep/16/revenge-of-the-childless-cat-ladies-podcast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 childless cat ladies}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D is nodding along furiously to all this, and taking notes for copycat legislation in the US.\par \par \uc2 US startup charging couples to \u8216\'20\'18screen embryos for IQ\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Video footage shot by the group Hope Not Hate and reviewed by the Guardian show the company Heliospect Genomic marketing its services at up to $50,000 for 100 embryos, with one manager boasting a possible gain of more six IQ points. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/science/2024/oct/18/us-startup-charging-couples-to-screen-embryos-for-iq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A genetics expert told the Guardian}}}\uc2  that one of the many problems with this \u8220\'20\'1Cis that it normalises this idea of \u8216\'20\'18superior\u8217\'20\'19 and \u8216\'20\'18inferior\u8217\'20\'19 genetics \u8230\'20\'26 [and] reinforces the belief that inequality comes from biology rather than social causes\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 UK women who suffer cardiac arrest in public less likely to get CPR\par \par \uc2 According {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/oct/16/uk-women-who-suffer-cardiac-arrest-in-public-less-likely-to-get-cpr-study-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to a new study}}}\uc2 , this is because bystanders worry about touching women\u8217\'20\'19s breasts when giving chest compressions. The report suggests better training could address this problem and save lives.\par \par \uc2 More American women than men have tattoos\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2023/08/15/32-of-americans-have-a-tattoo-including-22-who-have-more-than-one/#:~:text=The%20likelihood%20of%20having%20a,women%20ages%2030%20to%2049."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Thirty-eight percent of women v 27% of men}}}\uc2 , to be exact, according to \uc2 Pew Research Center\uc2 . The \uc2 Washington Post{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/wellness/2024/10/16/women-tattoos-body-art-autonomy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explores the ways}}}\uc2  that some women use tattoos to represent a way of \u8220\'20\'1Creclaiming control\u8221\'20\'1D over their bodies.\par \par \uc2 A South Korean court recognizes misogyny as a motive for hate crime in landmark ruling\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.scmp.com/lifestyle/article/3282840/south-korean-court-hailed-recognising-misogyny-anti-feminist-hate-crime-motive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruling was made}}}\uc2  in regards to a case where a woman was attacked by a man who shouted \u8220\'20\'1Cfeminists deserve to be beaten\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/east-asia/article/3240802/south-korea-short-haired-women-are-harassed-antifeminist-movement-grows?module=inline&pgtype=article"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 because she had short hair}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump calls himself the \u8216\'20\'18father of IVF\u8217\'20\'19 during a Fox News town hall\par \par \uc2 After this nonsensical statement, he added that he hadn\u8217\'20\'19t actually known what IVF was until Senator Katie Britt, whom Trump described as a \u8220\'20\'1Ca fantastically attractive person from Alabama\u8221\'20\'1D, explained it to him. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd within about two minutes, I understood it,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2024-election/trump-says-father-ivf-recently-learned-rcna175940"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the former president exclaimed}}}\uc2 . Donald: I\u8217\'20\'19m not sure you actually did.\par \par \uc2 Nicola Coughlan says being called a \u8216\'20\'18plus-size heroine\u8217\'20\'19 is insulting\par \par \uc2 Coughlan had strong words for viewers who called her \u8220\'20\'1Cbrave\u8221\'20\'1D for the nudity scenes in season 3 of Bridgerton. \u8220\'20\'1CDon\u8217\'20\'19t call me brave. I have a cracking pair of boobs \u8230\'20\'26 that\u8217\'20\'19s actually just me showing them off,\u8221\'20\'1D she told {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/collection/next-generation-leaders/7071916/nicola-coughlan-interview/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Time}}}\uc2  magazine. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m a few sizes below the average size of a woman in the UK and I\u8217\'20\'19m seen as a \u8216\'20\'18plus-size heroine\u8217\'20\'19 \u8230\'20\'26 Making it about how I look is reductive and boring.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Palestinian woman shot by the IDF while picking olives in the West Bank\par \par \uc2 Hanan Abu Salameh, 59, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.haaretz.com/israel-news/2024-10-17/ty-article/.premium/palestinian-woman-killed-by-idf-while-picking-olives-near-west-bank-separation-barrier/00000192-9a28-d751-a99f-de6d44fe0000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had been picking olives}}}\uc2  with her family when she was killed. Her son has said that the Israeli forces {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.middleeasteye.net/news/west-bank-woman-fatally-shot-back-israeli-soldiers-while-harvesting-olives"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started shooting randomly}}}\uc2  and shot his mother when she was fleeing. The IDF has said it is \u8220\'20\'1Cinvestigating\u8221\'20\'1D but, based on prior \u8220\'20\'1Cinvestigations\u8221\'20\'1D, one imagines nobody will be held accountable.\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 A US paraglider flying over Egypt\u8217\'20\'19s great pyramids {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/10/18/travel/dog-climbs-ancient-pyramids-egypt-paragliding/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recently spotted something unusual}}}\uc2  on top of the second-tallest pyramid. Was it a bird? Was it a plane? No, it was a dog that had seemingly summited the 448ft-tall structure so it could bark at birds. After a satisfying barking session, the dog {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/International/video/dog-spotted-atop-great-pyramid-giza-makes-expert-114921540"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made its way down}}}\uc2  safely. However, since climbing the pyramids is illegal, the adventurous animal could well find itself in the doghouse.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241019ekaj001gt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
