\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Melania Trump says Donald always knew she supported  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights\b0\par\par\uc2 Ramon Antonio Vargas \par \uc2 521 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2024\par 14:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ex-first lady tells Fox News husband who has boasted about role in overturning of Roe v Wade \u8216\'20\'18lets me be who I am\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  knew {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/melania-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Melania Trump}}}\uc2  supported \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights \u8220\'20\'1Csince the day [they] met\u8221\'20\'1D, the former US first lady said on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd I believe in individual freedom. I want to decide what I want to do with my body. I think I don\u8217\'20\'19t want government in my personal business,\u8221\'20\'1D Melania Trump added in an interview with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/media/fox-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fox News}}}\uc2 , during which she elaborated on a political position that left her at odds with the Republican party led by her husband.\par \par \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  was first to report on Wednesday how Melania Trump\u8217\'20\'19s eagerly anticipated memoir contained a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/02/melania-trump-memoir-defends-abortion-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 passionate defense of women\u8217\'20\'19s right}}}\uc2  to control their own bodies \u8211\'20\'13 including with respect to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access.\par \par \uc2 The book, Melania, is scheduled for release on Tuesday, less than a month before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  seeks a second presidency in the 5 November election. She reacted to Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s reporting in the Guardian with a social media statement on Thursday that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/03/melania-trump-memoir-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declared}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CIndividual freedom is a fundamental principle that I safeguard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump defended the decision to reveal her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related views so close to her husband\u8217\'20\'19s electoral showdown with \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , the vice-president and Democratic nominee.\par \par \uc2 Public polling has long held that most Americans favor access to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , and Democrats have translated that support into political victories during \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s presidency. But many Republican-led state legislatures have sought to restrict access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , mainly citing conservative religious beliefs, since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  eliminated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 federal-level \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights}}}\uc2  in June 2022.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWell, that was not written in the last week or the last month,\u8221\'20\'1D Melania Trump said. \u8220\'20\'1CThat book was written months before, and it was in print months before.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo that was my belief, and it is my belief, and I wanted to put it in the book because I want to be authentic.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Harris on Sunday appeared on the popular {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/oct/07/kamala-harris-call-her-daddy-podcast-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Call Her Daddy podcast}}}\uc2  and reminded listeners that three \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  justice appointed by Trump formed part of the conservative bloc that eliminated the federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights previously established by the landmark Roe v Wade decision.\par \par \uc2 Trump has previously spoken proudly of those judicial appointees and their decision as it pertained to Roe. Furthermore, the conservative thinktank \uc2 the Heritage Foundation\uc2 , which supports Trump, has openly called for the Food and Drug Administration to completely revoke its approval of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication mifepristone \u8211\'20\'13 and the group\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/project-2025-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Project 2025 plan}}}\uc2  has also pushed for the criminal prosecution of people who send \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills or tools through the mail.\par \par \uc2 Melania Trump nonetheless insisted that the former US president \u8220\'20\'1Clets me be who I am\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe lets me believe what I believe,\u8221\'20\'1D the former first lady remarked. \u8220\'20\'1CHe lets me be my own person. And he does respect that, and I respect that as I let him be his own person.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe has different beliefs, and he will do what he believes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241007eka7001ml\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
