\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18No room for compromise\u8217\'20\'19: Melania Trump reiterates  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights support\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 580 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2024\par 19:06 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ex-first lady calls reproductive freedom an \u8216\'20\'18essential right\u8217\'20\'19 in first public response to news of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights defenseUS politics \u8211\'20\'13 live updates\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/melania-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Melania Trump}}}\uc2  doubled down in her first public response to news of her passionate support for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights}}}\uc2 , a position starkly at odds with that of her husband, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , and the Republican party he leads.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIndividual freedom is a fundamental principle that I safeguard,\u8221\'20\'1D the former first lady {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/MELANIATRUMP/status/1841806743216537870"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in a video released on Thursday. \u8220\'20\'1CWithout a doubt, there is no room for compromise when it comes to this essential right that all women possess from birth. Individual freedom. What does \u8216\'20\'18My body, my choice\u8217\'20\'19 really mean?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Set to classical music and posted to social media, Trump\u8217\'20\'19s words were a paraphrase of those in her forthcoming memoir, Melania, which the Guardian revealed on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 On the page, Trump says: \u8220\'20\'1CIt is imperative to guarantee that women have autonomy in deciding their preference of having children, based on their own convictions, free from any intervention or pressure from the government.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhy should anyone other than the woman herself have the power to determine what she does with her own body? A woman\u8217\'20\'19s fundamental right of individual liberty, to her own life, grants her the authority to terminate her pregnancy if she wishes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRestricting a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to choose whether to terminate an unwanted pregnancy is the same as denying her control over her own body. I have carried this belief with me throughout my entire adult life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 News of that stance created a stir, a little over a month from election day in a campaign shaped by attacks on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 , the Republican party, and their donors and supporters.\par \par \uc2 In June 2022, in the supreme court case {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dobbs v Jackson}}}\uc2 , three hardline justices appointed by Trump voted to remove the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , marking a successful end to a 50-year crusade by religious conservatives. Draconian state bans followed \u8211\'20\'13 as did {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/sep/25/abortion-bans-healthcare-maternal-mortality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2  of women dying after being denied \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care.\par \par \uc2 Trump has claimed credit but also tried to lessen electoral damage, given clear majority support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights that has fueled a succession of Democratic electoral wins since the Dobbs decision.\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for the Republican nominee did not respond to a request for comment. Trump himself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/atrupar/status/1841964768669626443"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spoke to Fox News}}}\uc2 , while staging a rally in Saginaw, Michigan.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe spoke about it,\u8221\'20\'1D he said, when asked about his wife expressing support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in opposition to his record and platform.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAnd I said: \u8216\'20\'18You have to write what you believe.\u8217\'20\'19 I\u8217\'20\'19m not going to tell her what she should do. You have to write what you believe. She\u8217\'20\'19s very beloved. People love our former first lady, I can tell you that. But I said: \u8216\'20\'18You have to stick with your heart.\u8217\'20\'19 I\u8217\'20\'19ve said that to everybody, you have to go with your heart.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Sarafina Chitika, a spokesperson for \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , the Democratic nominee, said: \u8220\'20\'1CSadly for women across America, Mrs Trump\u8217\'20\'19s husband firmly disagrees with her and is the reason that more than one in three American women live under a Trump \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban that threatens their health, their freedom and their lives.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has made it abundantly clear: if he wins in November, he will ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  nationwide, punish women and restrict women\u8217\'20\'19s access to reproductive healthcare.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020241003eka300235\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9360\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\r